              "Index": 1
            }
          ],
          "DefaultAudioStreamIndex": 1
        },
        "received": {},
        "receiverAudio": false
      },
      "expected": [
        "This device does not support the HEVC Main 10 codec profile. The server converts the video.",
        "HEVC Main 10 exceeds the decoder's supported codec level. The server converts the video.",
        "This device does not recognize the HEVC Main 10 codec tag. The server makes a compatible stream.",
        "This device cannot decode HEVC Main 10 at this bit depth. The server converts the video.",
        "This device does not support the TRUEHD codec profile. The server converts the audio. Choose another audio track if available."
